<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Strategic Data Analyst Portfolio</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter for a clean, professional sans-serif look -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Font Awesome CDN for Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        /* --- CSS Variables & Reset --- */
        :root {
            /* Base Theme Colors */
            --bg-color: #0A192F; /* Deep Navy Background */
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #8892b0;
            --accent-color: #64ffda; /* Main Teal highlight */
            --accent-blue: #3b82f6; /* Secondary Blue for gradients/depth */
            
            /* Glassmorphism Base */
            --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            
            /* Layout & Interaction variables */
            --section-spacing: 100px;
            --card-radius: 16px;
            --transition-speed: 0.4s;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        /* --- Utility Classes --- */
        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 60px;
            height: 3px;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 0;
        }
        
        .section-title span {
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        /* Standard Glass Card */
        .glass-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* --- Header Section --- */
        header {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 0 5%;
        }

        .header-content h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .header-content .highlight {
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        /* Typing Animation Container */
        .typing-container {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 400;
            min-height: 1.6em; /* Prevent layout shift */
        }

        #typing-text {
            border-right: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding-right: 5px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* --- Core Competencies Section (Strength Cards) --- */
        #competencies {
            padding: var(--section-spacing) 0;
        }

        .cards-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .strength-card {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .strength-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -10px rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.3);
        }

        .card-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .strength-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .strength-card p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Interactive Metric Highlight */
        .card-metric {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            display: block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            opacity: 0.7;
            transform: scale(0.95);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .strength-card:hover .card-metric {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: scale(1.05);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(100, 255, 218, 0.5);
        }


        /* --- [INTEGRATED SECTION] Project Projects Framework --- */
        #projects-framework {
            padding: var(--section-spacing) 0;
        }

        .project-section-wrapper {
            margin-bottom: 6rem;
        }

        .project-header {
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
        }

        .project-header h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .project-header p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* Layered Process Grid Layout */
        .process-grid {
            display: flex;
            align-items: stretch;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 15px;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Flow Indicator Arrows */
        .flow-arrow {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.5;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        /* Base Step Card Styling (Specialized Glassmorphism) */
        .step-card {
            flex: 1;
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: var(--card-radius);
            padding: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 280px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Layered Depth Strategy */
        /* Step 1: Furthest away */
        .step-1 {
            z-index: 1;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
        /* Step 2 & 3: Mid-ground */
        .step-2 { z-index: 2; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); opacity: 0.9; }
        .step-3 { z-index: 3; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); opacity: 0.95; }

        /* Step 4: Closest, sharpest focus */
        .step-4 {
            z-index: 4;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            opacity: 1;
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        /* Step Content & Micro-Interactions */
        .step-header {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--accent-blue); /* Use secondary accent for labels */
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .step-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        /* The Reveal Mechanism */
        .step-details {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            opacity: 0; /* Hidden by default */
            transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: all var(--transition-speed) ease;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        /* Hover Effects for Steps */
        .step-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-15px) scale(1.02);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .step-card:hover .step-details {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }


        /* The Glow Effect for Results (Step 4) */
        @keyframes rotation {
            0% { --gradient-angle: 0deg; }
            100% { --gradient-angle: 360deg; }
        }

        @property --gradient-angle {
            syntax: "<angle>";
            initial-value: 0deg;
            inherits: false;
        }

        .result-glow {
            position: relative;
            background: rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.8) !important; /* Darker background for contrast */
        }

        /* The animated border glow layer */
        .result-glow::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: -2px;
            z-index: -1;
            background: conic-gradient(
                from var(--gradient-angle),
                var(--accent-blue),
                var(--accent-color),
                #8b5cf6, /* Purple addition for depth */
                var(--accent-blue)
            );
            border-radius: inherit;
            animation: rotation 8s linear infinite;
            filter: blur(12px);
            opacity: 0.7;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-speed);
        }
        
        .result-glow:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
            filter: blur(8px);
        }
        
        .result-highlight {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .result-highlight span {
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        /* --- Skill Dashboard Section --- */
        #skills {
            padding: var(--section-spacing) 0;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .skill-category h3 {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .skill-category h3 i {
            margin-right: 10px;
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        .skill-item {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .skill-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .progress-bar-bg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .progress-bar-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            border-radius: 4px;
            width: 0; /* Animated via JS later */
            transition: width 1s ease-in-out;
        }


        /* --- Footer --- */
        footer {
            padding: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }

        /* --- Responsive Design --- */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            /* Project Section Mobile Stacking */
            .process-grid {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 2rem;
            }

            .flow-arrow {
                display: none;
            }
            
            .step-card {
                min-height: auto;
                opacity: 1 !important;
                backdrop-filter: blur(10px) !important;
                z-index: 1 !important;
            }

            .step-details {
                opacity: 0.8; /* Visible on mobile by default */
                transform: translateY(0);
                margin-top: 15px;
            }
            
            .result-glow::before {
                opacity: 0.6;
                inset: -1px;
                filter: blur(8px);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header-content h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            
            .typing-container {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            
            .skills-grid {
                 grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header Section: Introduction & Value Proposition -->
    <header>
        <div class="container header-content">
            <h1>Hello, I'm a <span class="highlight">Strategic Analyst.</span></h1>
            <div class="typing-container">
                <span id="typing-text"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- Section 1: Core Competencies -->
        <section id="competencies">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title">Core Competencies</h2>
                <div class="cards-grid">
                    <!-- Card 1 -->
                    <article class="glass-card strength-card">
                        <div class="card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Data-Driven Analysis</h3>
                        <p>학원 행정 데이터를 구조화하여 업무 효율성을 극대화하고, 지적 장애 학생의 행동 패턴을 데이터로 지표화하여 맞춤형 교육의 근거를 마련했습니다.</p>
                        <span class="card-metric">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up"></i> 행정 프로세스 효율 최적화 달성
                        </span>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Card 2 -->
                    <article class="glass-card strength-card">
                        <div class="card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-compass"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Global Strategy & Planning</h3>
                        <p>노르웨이 대학 내 한국 문화 부스를 기획하며 현지 선호도 데이터를 분석, 타겟 맞춤형 전략으로 독보적인 성과를 창출했습니다.</p>
                        <span class="card-metric">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i> 문화 부스 참여율 전체 1위 달성
                        </span>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Card 3 -->
                    <article class="glass-card strength-card">
                        <div class="card-icon">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Digital Marketing Execution</h3>
                        <p>트렌드 데이터 기반의 카드뉴스 기획과 콘텐츠 최적화 전략을 통해 타겟 오디언스의 참여를 이끌어내고 영향력을 확대했습니다.</p>
                        <span class="card-metric">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i> 2,000+ 팔로워 계정 성장 견인
                        </span>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2: Project Framework (Integrated Layered Grid Section) -->
        <section id="projects-framework">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title">Strategic Impact Framework: <span>Data to Action</span></h2>

                <!-- ================= Project 01 ================= -->
                <div class="project-section-wrapper" id="project-1">
                    <div class="project-header">
                        <h3>PROJECT 01. 교육봉사 행정 효율화 (Data-Driven Efficiency)</h3>
                        <p>데이터 기반의 봉사자 그룹핑 및 리더제 도입을 통한 운영 프로세스 혁신</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="process-grid">
                        <!-- Step 1: Problem -->
                        <div class="step-card step-1">
                            <div class="step-header">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> STEP 01
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-title">Problem Recognition</div>
                            <div class="step-details">
                                <p>봉사자 간 업무 혼선 및 명확한 가이드라인 부재를 확인했습니다. 이로 인해 낮은 프로그램 이행률(초기 20% 수준)이 지속되는 문제를 인지했습니다.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></div>

                        <!-- Step 2: Analysis -->
                        <div class="step-card step-2">
                            <div class="step-header">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-chart"></i> STEP 02
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-title">Data Analysis</div>
                            <div class="step-details">
                                <p>기존의 학생성향분석 보고서를 심층 검토했습니다. 학생들의 '인지 수준'과 '주요 관심사'를 정량적 지표로 변환하여 데이터화했습니다.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></div>

                        <!-- Step 3: Action -->
                        <div class="step-card step-3">
                            <div class="step-header">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-chess-board"></i> STEP 03
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-title">Strategic Action</div>
                            <div class="step-details">
                                <p>분석된 지표를 기반으로 봉사 대상 학생을 3개 그룹으로 분류했습니다. 각 팀원의 강점에 맞춰 전담 리더제를 도입하여 맞춤형 대응 체계를 구축했습니다.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></div>

                        <!-- Step 4: Result (Glow Effect) -->
                        <div class="step-card step-4 result-glow">
                            <div class="step-header" style="color: var(--accent-color);">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i> STEP 04
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-title">Quantifiable Result</div>
                            <div class="step-details">
                                <p class="result-highlight">초기 대비 혁신적인 개선을 이루어, 최종적으로 <span>프로그램 이행률 100%를 달성</span>했습니다. 데이터 기반의 체계적 운영 구조를 확립했습니다.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <!-- ================= Project 02 ================= -->
                <div class="project-section-wrapper" id="project-2">
                    <div class="project-header" style="border-color: var(--accent-blue);">
                        <h3>PROJECT 02. 노르웨이 문화교류 전략 (Strategic Market Research)</h3>
                        <p>현지 트렌드 데이터 분석 기반의 타겟팅 및 지속가능한 네트워크 구축 전략</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="process-grid">
                        <!-- Step 1: Targeting -->
                        <div class="step-card step-1">
                            <div class="step-header">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i> STEP 01
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-title">Targeting & Research</div>
                            <div class="step-details">
                                <p>노르웨이 현지 대학생을 대상으로 한국 문화 선호도를 조사하고, 관련 SNS 트렌드 데이터를 수집 및 분석하여 잠재 수요를 파악했습니다.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></div>

                        <!-- Step 2: Strategy -->
                        <div class="step-card step-2">
                            <div class="step-header">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> STEP 02
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-title">Strategic Planning</div>
                            <div class="step-details">
                                <p>분석 결과를 바탕으로, 화제성 높은 '불닭볶음면'을 유입책(Hook)으로 활용하고, '김밥' 체험을 결합한 전략적 부스 콘텐츠를 기획했습니다.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></div>

                        <!-- Step 3: Networking -->
                        <div class="step-card step-3">
                            <div class="step-header">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake-simple"></i> STEP 03
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-title">Sustainable Networking</div>
                            <div class="step-details">
                                <p>일회성 행사에 그치지 않도록, 국제팀의 요청에 따라 격주 단위의 정기 문화교류 모임 프로세스를 설계하여 지속적인 관계 유지 기반을 마련했습니다.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></div>

                        <!-- Step 4: Outcome (Glow Effect) -->
                        <div class="step-card step-4 result-glow">
                            <div class="step-header" style="color: var(--accent-color);">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i> STEP 04
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-title">Successful Outcome</div>
                            <div class="step-details">
                                <p class="result-highlight">전략적 기획을 통해 <span>교내 부스 참여율 1위를 달성</span>했습니다. 또한, 현지 학생들과의 지속가능한 글로벌 네트워크를 성공적으로 구축했습니다.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: Skill Dashboard -->
        <section id="skills">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title">Analytical Tool Proficiency</h2>
                <div class="skills-grid cards-grid">
                    
                    <!-- Data Analysis Tools -->
                    <div class="glass-card skill-category">
                        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i> Data Analysis</h3>
                        
                        <div class="skill-item">
                            <div class="skill-info">
                                <span>SQL (MySQL/PostgreSQL)</span>
                                <span>85%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="progress-bar-bg">
                                <div class="progress-bar-fill" style="width: 85%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="skill-item">
                            <div class="skill-info">
                                <span>MS Excel (Advanced)</span>
                                <span>95%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="progress-bar-bg">
                                <div class="progress-bar-fill" style="width: 95%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="skill-item">
                            <div class="skill-info">
